    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >type your fingers off, trying to defend yourself and feel like a wannabe hacker in this fast paced typing game</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >hold your ground against ever growing waves of new and different enemies, with unique mechanics, varying in the movement, the way you have to spell them, or... well you will see\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >unlock new commands to type in, to use against the enemies in strategic ways</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >the roguelike system allows you to start over, still with all your unlocked commands</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >if you love typing and seek a challenge or want to learn to spell, this game is for you!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >global leaderboard! compete with other players for the top score</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>tho this game is not for everyone, be warned, true skill comes from practice</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >COMMANDS</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >there are many commands to unlock and TYPE IN :)</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3884500/extras/3b34ca382982dc3b617ad585a0d90063.avif?t=1755195687\" width=323 height=834 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >UPGRADES</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >you can buy upgrades to get longer runs :)</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3884500/extras/380b2ee11650233d8ed84a75d80937fc.avif?t=1755195687\" width=325 height=713 /></span></h2>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >type your fingers off, trying to defend yourself and feel like a wannabe hacker in this fast paced typing game</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >hold your ground against ever growing waves of new and different enemies, with unique mechanics, varying in the movement, the way you have to spell them, or... well you will see\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >unlock new commands to type in, to use against the enemies in strategic ways</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >the roguelike system allows you to start over, still with all your unlocked commands</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >if you love typing and seek a challenge or want to learn to spell, this game is for you!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >global leaderboard! compete with other players for the top score</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>tho this game is not for everyone, be warned, true skill comes from practice</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >COMMANDS</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >there are many commands to unlock and TYPE IN :)</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3884500/extras/3b34ca382982dc3b617ad585a0d90063.avif?t=1755195687\" width=323 height=834 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >UPGRADES</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >you can buy upgrades to get longer runs :)</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3884500/extras/380b2ee11650233d8ed84a75d80937fc.avif?t=1755195687\" width=325 height=713 /></span></h2>",
